-- Remove 194 phantom/duplicate constituencies (repless + wardless orphans).
-- Inventory: 13 federal, 109 senatorial, 72 state → counts land 360/109/990.
-- Durability: these are LEGACY DB residue from an old seed version — the current
-- constituencies.json (1459, clean), state-constituencies-overflow.json, and the
-- upsert_all_constituencies migration contain NONE of these codes, so nothing
-- reintroduces them. A fresh clone is already clean (delete no-ops); prod/staging
-- get the 194 removed. Idempotent (WHERE code IN (...)); unreferenced (0 positions/
-- ward-maps/senatorial-lga-maps/elections — verified).

